patch.summary:
PATCH /admin/listings/:id/feature
Toggle isFeatured and optional featuredUntil expiry.
Body: { isFeatured: boolean, featuredUntil?: string | null }

PATCH /admin/listings/:id/visibility
Toggle isHidden on a listing.
Body: { isHidden: boolean }

PATCH /admin/users/:id/commission
Set or clear a vendor's custom commission rate.
Body: { customCommissionRate: number | null }

post.summary:
POST /payments/listings/:id/promote
Vendor initiates a paid listing promotion via Stripe Checkout.
Body: { tier: SponsorTier, successUrl?: string, cancelUrl?: string }

Track a click / interaction event.

Use the `category` + `action` pair to describe each event, for example:
  { category: "listing_card", action: "view_listing", listingId: "..." }
  { category: "booking_flow", action: "start_booking", listingId: "..." }
  { category: "nav_menu", action: "open_category", label: "kayaks" }
